WEBVTT

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.310
I put up with everything.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.740
I believed
that if I put up with the pain,

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.160
there'd be light
at the end of the tunnel.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.660
But, nothing changed.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:23.580
The light just got farther away,
and darkness still surrounds me.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.100
Nothing changes.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.310
I can't change anything.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.930
That's why...

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.070
I'm going to stop now.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.780
I can't come to the phone
right now.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.640
Please leave your name

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.060
and message after the tone.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.960
W-What's going on!?

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.840
Matsuzaka, what are you doing?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.010
Didn't he leave for another city?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:04.450
No! No! You're not the one
who's getting Shio-chan!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.660
I'm the one who's going to be

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.870
Shio-chan's knight!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:18.920
Huh?

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.280
Why am I...

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.430
My head hurts...

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.100
Hi.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.280
Be quiet. There's something
I want to ask you.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.270
This is the girl

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:44.740
who helped me with you, right?

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:48.680
So, you knew?

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:52.180
You gave me information about Shio
even though you knew?

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.420
You're an accomplice?

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.320
If you make a scene, I'll beat you.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:16.060
Her name is Satou Matsuzaka.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.460
She's protecting Shio.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.590
Or keeping her locked up.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.780
Anyway, she's with Shio-chan.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.520
But that's all I know!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.660
I don't know where Matsuzaka is.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.950
It's true! Please, believe me!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.240
I lied to you

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:36.020
because she told me
that if I did that,

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:40.060
she'd let me see Shio-chan.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.700
That's right!
You're looking for Shio-chan, right?

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.430
Let's work together
and save Shio-chan!

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.170
I can talk to Matsuzaka.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:53.270
If we work together,
we can get Shio-chan back!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.810
Now that's a good plan!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.000
What are you talking about?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.820
What makes you think
you're worth that much?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:07.000
You smell like a dirty adult.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.910
I don't trust you anymore.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:15.480
Get a hold of Matsuzaka's address
at work.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.920
You'll help me?

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:20.130
I’m not helping.
I’m giving you an order.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.840
I know that it hurts

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:29.140
when someone pushes hard
on your nails.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.360
The sharp pain of having your nail
ripped off...

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.310
Then, a dull pain ensues
and persists...

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:37.470
Oozing... Oozing...

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.230
The pain controls your mind.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.570
Can you stand

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.340
that pain?

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.320
I got it! I got it!

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:55.310
Find her address and contact me.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.430
-Go!
-O-Okay.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.440
When we die,

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.900
I'll be your partner in crime.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.010
Thanks, Shio-chan.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:02.750
I was happy when you said
you'd fight together with me.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.580
Thanks to you,

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.610
I was able to stand again.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:09.280
Let's live together.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:12.600
So we don't lose each other
in the darkness,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.560
let's keep shouting "I love you."

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:19.100
That's what I'm going to live for.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.880
That reason only.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:46.400
Oh... What happened?

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.620
Come on. Come inside.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.830
Satou-chan, welcome.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.420
Starting today,
this is your new home.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:08.500
Love...

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.970
Love... Love...

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.260
Love is different for every person.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.430
The way it shines is different.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.690
But anyone can receive it.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:24.660
Once you experience it, your heart
feels fulfilled in an instant.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:27.820
I'm coming!

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.740
Welcome! I was waiting for you.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.610
It'll be fine!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.500
Love is something
that can't be seen.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:07.330
Love...

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.150
Auntie, you're hurt again.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:16.210
-Are you okay?
-Yeah.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.550
I'm okay.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.540
This is also love.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.160
There are many different flavors
of love.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.840
Strawberry, lemon, apple, and mint.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:31.090
There are also poisonous ones.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.710
Taste it. Swallow it.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:38.650
As long as there's some in the jar.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:41.450
When they run out, you add more.

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:43.070
Over and over again.

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:45.780
When I do that,
I feel surrounded by love,

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.020
and I feel happy.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:55.800
But, my heart still had a big hole
in the middle

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.110
all along.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:06.350
Auntie. Will you hear me out?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:07.710
What is it?

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.520
I killed someone.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.250
For someone I love.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:15.400
I’ll destroy the evidence
to pursue love,

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.680
and travel far away,
just the two of us. Help us out.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:22.470
Satou-chan, you're so amazing.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.110
Are you calling the police?

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:26.640
No.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:30.280
Some of the people that came here

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:32.940
also did things like that.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:36.360
But I loved them too.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:40.570
That's what my love is.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.490
So, of course...

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:45.660
I love you too, Satou-chan!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.920
But I'm not your one
and only love, right?

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:59.810
You love everyone.

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:02.390
There’s no one you love the most.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.320
I don't call that love.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.980
I'm sure of it now.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:11.850
Auntie.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.690
Your love is wrong.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.120
Ever since I was a child,

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.740
I wanted to experience love.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.450
You can't see love.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.870
I didn't know
what it looked like.

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:32.010
But I finally know
what it looks like now.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:33.700
When I met her,

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.610
I felt fulfilled for the first time
in my life.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.130
It was like a piece of snow.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.970
I held onto it,
and tried to take care of it.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:46.560
At times, I failed.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.470
But still,

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:52.400
she continues to fulfills me.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.290
It's strange.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.860
It keeps changing.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.640
I can't help but think

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.940
it's something sweeter than sugar.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.820
It's priceless and special.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.990
That's what my love is.

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:12.220
Oh. Good.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:13.920
You found love.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:17.840
I'm not going to criticize
your love.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.880
But you're still a kid.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:26.800
A kid who can't take responsibility
for herself.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:31.640
You want to overstep your bounds?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.560
Do it once you've grown up.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:38.790
That's right. You're completely
dependent on adults, after all.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.740
You sponge off
and cling onto them to live.

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:46.000
That's how it works, Satou-chan.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.410
You can't pursue love alone.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.680
That's the reality of things.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.820
Don't worry, Satou-chan.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:56.840
You'll grow up someday.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:59.670
You'll grow up into a dirty adult
in no time.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.960
So,

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.980
keep acting like an innocent child.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.150
Even if you can't get what you want,

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.510
you can still do your best.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:12.060
That's all you can do.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:15.190
You're just a cute kid.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:20.320
You taught that kid the wrong idea
about love.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:25.300
That's why you have a responsibility
to pay me back.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.490
A responsibility to help me.

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:31.830
Take responsibility for doing this
to me.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.810
You're a dirty adult.
Take responsibility, Auntie.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.330
Responsibility, huh?

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.110
I've never thought about it before.

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.420
Okay, Satou-chan.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.270
I'll help you.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:00.190
Let me watch your love
until the end.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.610
And what happens to you
in the end.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.870
I'll come again.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.970
Hey, Satou-chan.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:19.170
You killed that little bird, right?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.680
It's okay.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.090
I won't do anything.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.150
I'll help you.

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.400
I swear on my love.

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:39.400
But... I see...

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:43.000
She's gone now.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.000
That's too bad.

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:06.920
Mitsuboshi! What a relief!

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.860
Sorry.

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:10.550
Sorry to make you worry.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:13.390
I thought I'd say hi today.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.310
I'm glad you came back.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.080
Actually, we're in a tight spot.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:23.270
Last night, Matsuzaka told us
she can't come in for a while.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.540
I thought I'd ask Shoko
to work instead,

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:29.570
but I can't get a hold of her.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:32.960
Sorry I can't help.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.670
It’s not your fault.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.660
We'll get through this today.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.300
You're more than welcome
to start tomorrow.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.080
-Okay.
-Thanks.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.990
There it is! This is it!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.210
This is good.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:08.480
Hida...

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.670
They can't get a hold of her?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.050
Stop. I don't have time
to think about it now.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.430
I’m not helping.

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:30.130
I’m giving you an order.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.050
That's right.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:36.240
I don't have to take orders
from you!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:43.230
-Shio-chan, are you scared of cars?
-A little.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.110
It'll be fine.

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:47.650
-I'll hold your hand.
-Okay.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.120
Satou-chan! Thanks for waiting!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.950
Auntie, that was dangerous.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.640
Can you really drive?

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:06.000
It'll be fine! Oh!

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:09.420
So, you're Satou-chan's love.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.780
You're so small and cute!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.600
I'm Satou-chan's aunt.
Nice to meet you!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.620
I'm Shio Koube!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.940
I've been together with Satou-chan!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.980
Nice to meet you!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.890
Shio-chan. She's kind of weird.

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.890
Don't talk to her too much.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:39.050
Huh? But she's your aunt, right?

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.910
I want to be friends!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.580
Shio-chan!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.270
Oh, Satou-chan!

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:48.270
You look so cute when you're with
the person you love!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.770
Well then, let's go!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:59.550
My crimes are all in that room.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:02.930
That's why I want to erase them
without a trace.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.780
Good idea.

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:08.610
Kose... Remember that policeman?

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.270
I asked him about it.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.080
But no one has reported

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.660
that anything happened
to the little bird yet.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.460
After I take care of this,

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:22.370
I plan to go somewhere
where no one knows us.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:42.260
We're going to live together
in a new place.

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:45.070
What a nice honeymoon!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:49.690
We have to buy time
until we can escape completely.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:01.910
So, our story is that I'm the one
who died in that room.

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.250
I'm not at home right now.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:12.810
Please leave a message
after the tone.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:17.340
Hey! What's taking you so long?
Hurry up and call me back!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:32.540
Shio-chan's on the other side
of this door!

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:35.150
Shio-chan's right here!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.310
Just thinking about it

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:40.820
makes my body shiver in pleasure!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.920
Shio-chan's voice, her smell...

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.370
I can experience them again!

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.290
Shio-chan!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.210
I've come for you!

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.640
Shio-chan?

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:11.900
Shio-chan? Where are you?

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:18.990
This isn't Shio-chan's
sweet smell...

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.180
Oh...

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:32.080
Are you starving for love too?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:49.030
I hope today will be the start
of a good journey.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:51.450
Let's make a vow.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:55.150
An eternal vow.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.070
Shio-chan!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.410
Yeah. Let's begin.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:10.600
Our vows.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.800
In sickness

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.010
and in health,

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.850
through happiness

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.710
and sadness,

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.350
for richer,

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:22.470
for poorer...

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:25.490
until death do us part...

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:30.030
I wish to stay connected
with you forever, Shio-chan.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:33.560
I wish to be together
with you forever, Satou-chan.

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:38.460
This is a symbol of our love.

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:43.120
I vow that I love you, Shio-chan.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:44.710
I vow that

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:47.630
I love you, Satou-chan.

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:53.290
Tomorrow, we'll leave this place
and find a new castle.

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:59.100
But, I don't need a castle.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:02.610
As long as you're with me,
that's enough for me!

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:13.120
I'd do anything for you,
Shio-chan.

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:16.320
I can feel the hole in my heart

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:18.650
filling up.

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:21.410
This love

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:23.500
is forever.

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:00.140
Satou-chan!

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:01.760
Shio-chan!

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:03.470
Satou-chan!

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:06.170
Shio-chan!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:09.510
12th Life:
Happy Sugar Life.
